              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">mTLS, ephemeral certs, rate limited</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">2 lines of YAML</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">Requires azd CLI</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700">
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">VS Code Dev Containers</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400">Varies by implementation</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400">devcontainer.json + VS Code</td>
              <td class="py-3 px-4 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">VS Code–specific, not portable</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700">
              <td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Mount ~/.azure</td>
